    {"personaje": "Ben", "linea": "And this is my dog. His name is Sherlock. He is very clever!"},
    {"personaje": "Kenji", "linea": "My sister and I share our computer. Her games are on it too."},
    {"personaje": "Abuela Carmen", "linea": "My grandchildren visit me every Sunday. Their laughter fills my house."}
